   "text": {
    "en": "Item (j) of paragraph numbered four under the heading \"IV-Special Appropriations\" on pages\nfifty-nine and sixty, English version, of the Appropriation Act, tor the year nineteen hundred and thirty-eight\nis amended so as to read as follows:\n\"4. For salaries and wagers and other expenses in connection with the administration of the non-Christian\ninhabitants in regularly organized provinces and in the Province of Palawan, to be spent at the discretion of\nthe secretary of the Interior:\nSALARIES AND WAGES\n(a) Three delegates, at ?5,100 per annum each .................................................................\n?15,300.00\n(b) One delegate, at ?4,020 per annum................................................................................\n4,020.00\n(c) One secret agent, at ?1,080 per annum .........................................................................\n1,080.00\nSuperintendents of non-Christians\n(d) One general superintendent .....................................................................................\n3,000.00\n(e) One superintendent..................................................................................................\n900.00\n(j) One superintendent..................................................................................................\n1,200.00\n(g) Two superintendents, at ?540 per annum each ......................................................\n1,080.00\n(h) One superintendent.................................................................................................\n360.00\n\nSpecial Agents, etc.\n(i) One special agent................................................................................................\n2,400.00\n(j) Two secret agents, at P1,080 per annum each...................................................\n2,160.00\n(k) One secret agent...............................................................................................\n720.00\n(l) Two secret agents, at P600 per annum each........................................................\n1,200.00\n(m) Two laborers, at P360 per annum each............................................................\n720.00\nTotal salaries and wages (P26,940)\n?34,140.00\nSUNDRY EXPENSES\n(n) Traveling expenses of personnel......................................................................\n?5,400.00\n(o) Postal, telegraph, telephone, cable and radio service.......................................\n50.00\n(v) Consumption of supplies and materials...........................................................\n800.00\n(q) Miscellaneous and incidental expenses ............................................................ (?8,500)\n5,560.00\nTotal sundry expenses........................................................................................... (?19,010)\n?11.810.00\nTotal for salaries and wages................................................................................. (?26,940)\n?34,140.00\nTotal for sundry expenses.................................................................................... (?9,010)\n?11,810.00\n?45,850.00\""
